-- a deterministic ORDER BY is rewritten (control)
1
-- a non-deterministic ORDER BY (rand) must NOT be rewritten (it would be evaluated twice)
0
-- rand nested in the sort expression is also rejected
0
-- rand in a secondary sort key is also rejected
0
-- a function that is constant within the query (now) is still rewritten
1
-- both arms of a UNION ALL are rewritten (traversal must not stop after the first)
2
-- the UNION ALL result is unchanged by the rewrite
0	0
