99	990
-- a table with a normal projection must NOT be rewritten (projection reads use projection-local part offsets)
0
-- an aggregate projection does not block the rewrite (it cannot serve a non-aggregate read)
1
-- LIMIT ... WITH TIES must NOT be rewritten (the outer LIMIT is what resolves the ties)
0
-- LIMIT ... WITH TIES returns the same rows with the rewrite enabled and disabled
